WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Welcome back to Building
Global Secure Access.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:07.387
This is Chapter 2: the configuration
export, and logs first.

3
00:00:07.387 --> 00:00:10.031
Every later chapter reads the same export,

4
00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:14.638
and nothing is enforced before the logs
exist, so this chapter builds both.

5
00:00:14.638 --> 00:00:19.297
We'll start from Learn's advice to back
the configuration up as Graph JSON,

6
00:00:19.297 --> 00:00:22.304
see what it leaves to you,
read the kit's collector,

7
00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:25.762
its manifest and five baseline
checks, and walk two labs.

8
00:00:25.762 --> 00:00:28.276
The chapter is a draft awaiting review,

9
00:00:28.276 --> 00:00:31.870
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
